<title>SLOVENIA: Slovenia January producer prices up 5.8 pct y/y.</title>
<headline>Slovenia January producer prices up 5.8 pct y/y.</headline>
<dateline>LJUBLJANA 1997-02-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Slovenian Statistical Office reported the following economic indicator details on Thursday.</p>
<p>    SLOVENIA PRODUCER PRICES	  Jan	Dec     Jan 96</p>
<p>    monthly change (percent)	  0.3	1.1	0.3</p>
<p>    Yr/yr change (percent)	    5.8	5.8	7.1</p>
<p>-- Novica Mihajlovic, Ljubljana newsroom, 386-61-125-8439</p>
</text>
